  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Kostky cukru</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> March 2017 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Série fotografií vznikla během talentových zkoušek na Střední odborné škole obchodu, užitého umění a designu v Plzni (Nerudova 33).</p>\n<p>Pro fotografickou část zkoušek jsme si mohli přinést vlastní objekty, ale jejich počet i velikost byly omezené. Přinesl jsem si krabičku kostek cukru, které jsem skládal na talíř do pravidelného rastru a následně je zalil vodou. Kostky se postupně rozpouštěly, bortily a náhodně padaly.</p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-1.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-2.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-3.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-4.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-5.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-6.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-7.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-8.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-9.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-10.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-11.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-12.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-13.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-14.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-15.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-16.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Sugar Cubes</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> March 2017 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>This series of photographs was created during talent auditions at the Secondary Vocational School of Commerce, Applied Arts, and Design in Pilsen (Nerudova 33).</p>\n<p>For the photography portion of the auditions, we were allowed to bring our own objects, but their number and size were limited. I brought a box of sugar cubes, which I arranged on a plate in a regular grid and then poured water over them. The sugar cubes gradually dissolved, crumbled, and fell randomly.</p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-1.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-2.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-3.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-4.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-5.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-6.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-7.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-8.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-9.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-10.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-11.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-12.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-13.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-14.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-15.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-16.jpg\"> <img src=\"/images/kostky-cukru-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div> </div> ",
